1
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,520
Who's there?

2
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:40,120
Li Zhi'an, you're not really blind, are you?

3
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:43,040
Was it you who killed the Western Envoy last night?

4
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,280
What are you talking about?

5
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,240
Our Crown Princess was in her room all night.

6
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,720
I stood guard outside her door the entire night.

7
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:48,720
She definitely didn't leave.

8
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:49,080
Ridiculous!

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:50,280
With her skills,

10
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,240
if she weren't blind,

11
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,280
do you think you'd have noticed?

12
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,120
Step aside!

13
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:56,600
Li Zhi'an, come with me to see the Third Prince. Now!

14
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,040
Let her go!

15
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,520
Didn't you hear what I said?

16
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:10,440
My husband...

17
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,960
Was it you who saved me last night?

18
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,160
Can you really see?

19
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,320
If it's true,

20
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,080
that would be wonderful.

21
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,480
Footprints with Northern Jin patterns...

22
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:24,960
Exactly.

23
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:28,400
Ever since the Northern Jin spy incident in Southern Liang,

24
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,560
there has been virtually no contact between our two nations.

25
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:34,000
The only person who could leave such footprints in the prince's residence

26
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,360
is Li Zhi'an.

27
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,560
My lord, I suspect Li Zhi'an was never actually blind.

28
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,840
She's been pretending to be blind to stay by your side

29
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,160
and seek revenge.

30
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,400
Hmph.

31
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:50,120
My lord,

32
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,160
let me personally test her.

33
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,720
I refuse to believe she won't slip up.

34
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,000
Wait.

35
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,800
Send the Seventh Prince instead.

36
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:03,440
I sense he's changed recently.

37
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:06,120
The Western Envoy's death was suspicious,

38
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,200
and the Dragon Jade remains missing.

39
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:12,760
It's time we test his loyalty.

40
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,160
What are they planning?

41
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:26,040
Husband, where are we?

42
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,000
A hot spring retreat.

43
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:30,920
Really?

44
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,160
Then why do I smell something greasy?

45
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,520
It's the scent of hot springs

46
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:38,480
Don't worry

47
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:45,960
Zhu Huaijin

48
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,640
What are you going to do?

49
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,080
Oil pot

50
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,520
Seems they suspect me now

51
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,440
If I move right now

52
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,160
I might lose my life

53
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:05,440
My lord, where are you?

54
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,040
What is this?

55
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,400
Why splash it on my face?

56
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,320
So you're truly blind

57
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,200
Sorry about that, Zhi'an

58
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,760
This is medicinal oil and vinegar

59
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,240
I didn't control my strength well

60
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,880
Are you okay?

61
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,960
Why...

62
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,760
Why is the Seventh Prince so gentle with her?

63
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,600
Why does it always come down to this tiny difference?

64
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,080
Li Zhi'an

65
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:59,680
Your good luck won't last much longer

66
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:08,520
So adding vinegar to oil

67
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:11,920
can make it boil without getting too hot

68
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:13,840
Yes, Your Highness

69
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,720
When it comes to culinary matters

70
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:18,760
Huashan is the one to ask

71
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:21,640
Her cooking is the best in our mansion

72
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,640
Perhaps

73
00:04:22,640 --> 00:04:25,080
Huashan could even become a chef in the imperial kitchen someday

74
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,600
Hualan, what nonsense are you saying

75
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,360
Don't tease me like that

76
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:31,480
The imperial kitchen is no place for women

77
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:36,880
Yet in every household across the land, it's mostly women who cook

78
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,000
Is there any kitchen door that women cannot enter?

79
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,080
Huashan, if you have such aspirations

80
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,480
I'll provide you with funds

81
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:45,760
to open an eatery in the city center

82
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:48,000
At least you could earn some income

83
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,640
Don't let the world think

84
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:52,440
that only men can achieve fame and fortune

85
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:56,040
while we women are confined to cooking at home for free

86
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,600
Your Highness, Huashan wouldn't dare

87
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,080
Get up quickly

88
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,800
If you don't dare

89
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:08,280
then let Hualan, the clever one, be your shop manager

90
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,960
You just need to cook in the kitchen

91
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:13,040
When we make profits

92
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:15,560
we'll split it fifty-fifty, how about that?

93
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,960
Is the princess consort serious?

94
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,680
Of course, when have I ever deceived you?

95
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,880
Huamei, bring their contracts of indenture

96
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,800
Yes

97
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,240
Also bring an extra set of paper and brush

98
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:27,200
I'll dictate and you draw

99
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:30,040
Let's design a shop sign pattern for this eatery

100
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:31,200
Alright

101
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:40,280
First draw a sun-like shape

102
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,800
Then water splash patterns

103
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:49,880
Draw another one

104
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:03,080
Let's get prepared quickly

105
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,160
Yes

106
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,400
The old Li family retainers will arrive in Nanliang these days

107
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,360
If we put our Li family's secret symbols

108
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:19,200
on the shop's signboard

109
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:21,720
they'll surely come when they see it

110
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:30,640
I never expected the princess consort

111
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,240
would actually give us our contracts

112
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:34,160
She genuinely wants to help us open this eatery

113
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,960
Tonight is our last night at the prince's residence

114
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,360
I hope the princess consort will enjoy the midnight snack I prepared

115
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:44,080
So happy serving a blind person

116
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:46,000
What kind of spell did Li Zhi'an cast on them?

117
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,640
Chi Yu

118
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:52,240
Here, yes
